## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-inference skeleton for two-tower model
function twoTowerInfer(input, tenantId, model) {
  // shared backbone
  const shared = model.backbone.extract(input.features)
  // tenant-specific embedding
  const emb = model.tenantEmbeddings[tenantId](input.userId)
  // combine and head with early exit
  const fused = concatenate(shared, emb)
  return model.heads[0](fused) // early exit path
}
```

